      },
      "notes": {
        "summary": "The kernel as nine typed modules that pass the strict check. Levels of static bodies cost a step nothing, bodies at rest keep their contacts, and a world that has had bodies taken out steps as a new one does. New: capsule sweeps, and a character that walks, climbs steps and slopes, rides lifts and crouches. A rotation's parts are now turn and turnW, and a contact's bodies first and second."
      },
